{"title":"Graymaw","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Graymaw is a named <a href=\"#/monster/yeti-ravager\">Yeti Ravager</a> seen at level 60.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Graymaw</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 455, -980</li><li>in the wilds around 455, -971</li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"graymaw\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"yeti-fang\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/b964f6987e786c9b807e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Yeti Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">15 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-feet\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7ce6de157efd9abd04f5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/18aad708801ed6539ecc.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Graymaw</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/yeti-ravager\">Yeti Ravager</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>60</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>1,365</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>72 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}